pan class='font-ascii' style='color:#FFAA00'><span class='font-common'>\ue005</span>4000%</span> and enkindling Buckshot's arrows with <span class='font-ascii' style='color:#FFAA00'><span class='font-common'>\ue005</span>20%</span> Main Attack damage.</span></span></span>"}, "powderSlots": 2, "lore": "<span class='font-ascii' style='color:#AAAAAA'>The end comes in threes: first a deep and neverending shadow, suffocating all within its grasp. Then, a piercing blinding radiance, overtaking all within its sight. Finally, the in-between: chaos, bloodshed, war, a conflict which will sweep the land. Each end inevitable; but none a guarantee.</span>", "identifications": {"exploding": {"min": 9, "raw": 31, "max": 40}, "rawHealth": {"min": -2860, "raw": -2200, "max": -1540}, "waterDefence": {"min": -39, "raw": -30, "max": -21}, "4thSpellCost": {"min": -7, "raw": -25, "max": -32}, "rawFireDamage": {"min": 60, "raw": 200, "max": 260}, "rawAttackSpeed": 1}, "base": {"baseAirDamage": {"min": 30, "raw": 30, "max": 90}, "baseFireDamage": {"min": 50, "raw": 50, "max": 70}, "baseThunderDamage": {"min": 20, "raw": 20, "max": 120}}}, {"displayName": "Halcyon", "internalName": "Halcyon", "type": "weapon", "subType": "wand", "icon": {"value": {"id": "minecraft:potion", "name": "wand.multi3", "customModelData": {"rangeDispatch": [4333]}}, "format": "attribute"}, "emblem": "diamond_6", "tier": "mythic", "attackSpeed": "fast", "averageDps": 492, "restriction": "none", "dropRestriction": "normal", "elements": ["air", "thunder", "water"], "requirements": {"level": 118, "classRequirement": "mage", "agility": 50, "dexterity": 50, "intelligence": 60}, "majorIds": {"Blinding Lights": "<span class='font-ascii' style='color:#AAAAAA'>All Ophanim orbs deal 250% damage, gain +5 Crystallize per hit, and instead orbit around you. Using Main Attack causes all orbs to travel faster.</span>"}, "powderSlots": 3, "lore": "<span class='font-ascii' style='color:#AAAAAA'>As a flashing star shot through the night sky, a sole observer witnessed its brilliance. It was then, wreathed in prismatic light, he decided. Someday, he would shine as bright as that star, and overtake those beneath him. No matter the cost.</span>", "identifications": {"rawHealth": {"min": -4290, "raw": -3300, "max": -2310}, "reflection": {"min": 15, "raw": 50, "max": 65}, "rawStrength": -50, "elementalDefence": {"min": 9, "raw": 30, "max": 39}, "raw4thSpellCost": {"min": -1, "raw": -5, "max": -6}, "healingEfficiency": {"min": 8, "raw": 28, "max": 36}, "rawElementalSpellDamage": {"min": 90, "raw": 300, "max": 390}}, "base": {"baseAirDamage": {"min": 50, "raw": 50, "max": 80}, "baseFireDamage": {"min": 1, "raw": 1, "max": 1}, "baseEarthDamage": {"min": 1, "raw": 1, "max": 1}, "baseWaterDamage": {"min": 60, "raw": 60, "max": 70}, "baseThunderDamage": {"min": 40, "raw": 40, "max": 90}}}, {"displayName": "Transfiguration", "internalName": "Transfiguration", "type": "weapon", "subType": "relik", "icon": {"value": {"id": "minecraft:potion", "name": "relik.air3", "customModelData": {"rangeDispatch": [3637]}}, "format": "attribute"}, "emblem": "diamond_6", "tier": "mythic", "attackSpeed": "superFast", "averageDps": 838, "restriction": "none", "dropRestriction": "normal", "elements": ["earth", "thunder", "air"], "requirements": {"level": 117, "classRequirement": "shaman", "agility": 55, "strength": 70, "dexterity": 70}, "majorIds": {"Flain Remnants": "<span class='font-ascii' style='color:#AAAAAA'>Destroying a Puppet with Friendly Fire calls forth a Remnant. (Max 5) Each Remnant lasts for 20 seconds, fires an explosive tracking projectile every second that deals <span class='font-ascii' style='color:#FFAA00'><span class='font-common'>\ue005</span>95%</span>, and increases your Main Attack damage by 15%.</span></span>"}, "powderSlots": 3, "lore": "<span class='font-ascii' style='color:#AAAAAA'>Desperation breeds creativity. What would it take to force your will upon the world? To bend and break and weave existence, to bypass the immutable? The result is different, wrong, anathema to your being... but it is freedom from the chains that bind you. It is enough.</span>", "identifications": {"manaSteal": {"min": 6, "raw": 20, "max": 26}, "rawAgility": 20, "rawMaxMana": {"min": -39, "raw": -30, "max": -21}, "sprintRegen": {"min": 9, "raw": 31, "max": 40}, "rawAttackSpeed": 5, "rawElementalDamage": {"min": 66, "raw": 220, "max": 286}}, "base": {"baseAirDamage": {"min": 30, "raw": 30, "max": 100}, "baseEarthDamage": {"min": 60, "raw": 60, "max": 70}, "baseThunderDamage": {"min": 0, "raw": 0, "max": 130}}}, {"displayName": "Vengeance", "internalName": "Vengeance", "type": "weapon", "subType": "dagger", "icon": {"value": {"id": "minecraft:potion", "name": "dagger.thunder3", "customModelData": {"rangeDispatch": [875]}}, "format": "attribute"}, "emblem": "diamond_6", "tier": "mythic", "attackSpeed": "superSlow", "averageDps": 790, "restriction": "none", "dropRestriction": "normal", "elements": ["earth", "thunder", "fire"], "requirements": {"level": 116, "classRequirement": "assassin", "defence": 50, "strength": 60, "dexterity": 60}, "majorIds": {"Manic Edge": "<span class='font-ascii' style='color:#AAAAAA'>While vanished, lose 5% of your max mana per second. Surprise Strike further increases your damage by 3% per mana lost from this effect, up to 70%.</span>"}, "powderSlots": 3, "lore": "<span class='font-ascii' style='color:#AAAAAA'>A strength fueled by rage, merciless, unending. A hatred, all-consuming, that erodes all other thought, all sense of being. An ally so fickle, so selfish, that leaves you aimless at the moment of pyrrhic triumph.</span>", "identifications": {"damage": {"min": 8, "raw": 28, "max": 36}, "manaSteal": {"min": -19, "raw": -15, "max": -10}, "healthRegen": {"min": 100, "raw": 333, "max": 433}, "3rdSpellCost": {"min": -4, "raw": -14, "max": -18}, "healthRegenRaw": {"min": -9100, "raw": -7000, "max": -4900}}, "base": {"baseDamage": {"min": 500, "raw": 500, "max": 800}, "baseFireDamage": {"min": 200, "raw": 200, "max": 400}, "baseEarthDamage": {"min": 250, "raw": 250, "max": 350}, "baseThunderDamage": {"min": 150, "raw": 150, "max": 450}}}, {"displayName": "Epoch", "internalName": "Masterwork Epoch", "type": "weapon", "subType": "bow", "icon": {"value": {"id": "minecraft:potion", "name": "bow.basicGold", "customModelData": {"rangeDispatch": [304]}}, "format": "attribute"}, "emblem": "diamond_6", "tier": "mythic", "attackSpeed": "superSlow", "averageDps": 877, "restriction": "none", "dropRestriction": "never", "elements": ["thunder", "air"], "requirements": {"level": 114, "classRequirement": "archer", "agility": 70, "dexterity": 70}, "powderSlots": 3, "lore": "<span class='font-ascii' style='color:#AAAAAA'>This ornate bow holds a sinister beauty. Each rediscovery marks impending disaster, against any force that attempts to overcome it. Such is the inevitability of fate: irreverent to the will of masses, an epoch starts anew.</span>", "identifications": {"sprint": {"min": 21, "raw": 70, "max": 91}, "lifeSteal": {"min": 277, "raw": 923, "max": 1200}, "manaSteal": {"min": -8, "raw": -6, "max": -4}, "walkSpeed": {"min": -26, "raw": -20, "max": -14}, "spellDamage": {"min": 15, "raw": 50, "max": 65}, "mainAttackRange": {"min": 9, "raw": 31, "max": 40}, "raw1stSpellCost": {"min": -1, "raw": -5, "max": -6}, "raw4thSpellCost": {"min": -1, "raw": -5, "max": -6}, "rawMainAttackDamage": {"min": 231, "raw": 769, "max": 1000}}, "base": {"baseDamage": {"min": 520, "raw": 520, "max": 660}, "baseAirDamage": {"min": 530, "raw": 530, "max": 600}, "baseThunderDamage": {"min": 510, "raw": 510, "max": 620}}}, {"displayName": "Cataclysm", "internalName": "Masterwork Cataclysm", "type": "weapon", "subType": "dagger", "icon": {"value": {"id": "minecraft:potion", "name": "dagger.thunder3", "customModelData": {"rangeDispatch": [875]}}, "format": "attribute"}, "emblem": "diamond_6", "tier": "mythic", "attackSpeed": "superFast", "averageDps": 968, "restriction": "none", "dropRestriction": "never", "elements": ["thunder"], "requirements": {"level": 113, "classRequirement": "assassin", "dexterity": 120}, "powderSlots": 3, "lore": "<span class='font-ascii' style='color:#AAAAAA'>Despite the existence of the Nether Portal, few believe that it is possible to open such rifts with sheer force alone. None believe that a tool with enough power to accomplish such a monumental feat could exist. And yet...</span>", "identifications": {"thorns": {"min": 12, "raw": 40, "max": 52}, "stealing": {"min": 2, "raw": 5, "max": 7}, "rawHealth": {"min": -7800, "raw": -6000, "max": -4200}, "rawDexterity": 30, "thunderDamage": {"min": 9, "raw": 31, "max": 40}, "raw1stSpellCost": {"min": -1, "raw": -4, "max": -5}, "raw3rdSpellCost": {"min": -1, "raw": -4, "max": -5}}, "base": {"baseDamage": {"min": 25, "raw": 25, "max": 120}, "baseThunderDamage": {"min": 45, "raw": 45, "max": 260}}}, {"displayName": "Immolation", "internalName": "Masterwork Immolation", "type": "weapon", "subType": "relik", "icon": {"value": {"id": "minecraft:potion", "name": "relik.fire3", "customModelData": {"rangeDispatch": [3676]}}, "format": "attribute"}, "emblem": "diamond_6", "tier": "mythic", "attackSpeed": "slow", "averageDps": 1020, "dropRestriction": "never", "elements": ["fire", "air"], "requirements": {"level": 113, "classRequirement": "shaman", "agility": 75, "defence": 75}, "majorIds": {"Blazing Effigy": "<span class='font-ascii' style='color:#AAAAAA'> Regeneration increases Totem's damage by <span class='font-ascii' style='color:#FFAA00'><span class='font-common'>\ue005</span>+14%</span> <span class='font-ascii' style='color:#FF5555'><span class='font-common'>\ue002</span>+6%</span> instead of restoring health.</span></span></span>"}, "powderSlots": 3, "lore": "<span class='font-ascii' style='color:#AAAAAA'>The act of self-immolation is never taken lightly, and is always a sacrifice. This idol was carved to honor one such instance, in which a master of flame burned through his life force in a final act of heroism-purging an encroaching army of the undead, saving the people of the jungle from destruction.</span>", "identifications": {"airDamage": {"min": 23, "raw": 76, "max": 99}, "fireDamage": {"min": 23, "raw": 76, "max": 99}, "rawAgility": 75, "rawDefence": 75, "healthRegen": {"min": -104, "raw": -80, "max": -56}, "1stSpellCost": {"min": -6, "raw": -19, "max": -25}, "3rdSpellCost": {"min": -8, "raw": -27, "max": -35}, "healingEfficiency": {"min": -650, "raw": -500, "max": -350}}, "base": {"baseAirDamage": {"min": 325, "raw": 325, "max": 355}, "baseFireDamage": {"min": 205, "raw": 205, "max": 475}}}, {"displayName": "Ascendancy", "internalName": "Ascendancy", "type": "weapon", "subType": "spear", "icon": {"value": {"id": "minecraft:potion", "name": "spear.fire3", "customModelData": {"rangeDispatch": [3833]}}, "format": "attribute"}, "emblem": "diamond_6", "tier": "mythic", "attackSpeed": "fast", "averageDps": 544, "restriction": "none", "dropRestriction": "normal", "elements": ["water", "fire", "air"], "requirements": {"level": 112, "classRequirement": "warrior", "agility": 60, "defence": 60, "intelligence": 60}, "majorIds": {"Divine Right": "<span class='font-ascii' style='color:#AAAAAA'>Your Maximum Health is reduced by 75%. For every 100 HP lost, Sacred Surge's damage is increased by 3%.</span>"}, "powderSlots": 3, "lore": "<span class='font-ascii' style='color:#AAAAAA'>There is very little outside the purview of those with power. No matter the circumstance, those in a higher position can, will, and have justified their actions in different ways. Some reasons are fine, some are weak. But what sort of justification is there, for those in the highest position? You have the floor.</span>", "identifications": {"rawHealth": {"min": 808, "raw": 2692, "max": 3500}, "reflection": {"min": 15, "raw": 50, "max": 65}, "fireDamage": {"min": 17, "raw": 58, "max": 75}, "jumpHeight": {"min": 1, "raw": 3, "max": 4}, "rawStrength": -250, "rawDexterity": -250, "rawSpellDamage": {"min": 75, "raw": 250, "max": 325}}, "base": {"baseDamage": {"min": 30, "raw": 30, "max": 30}, "baseAirDamage": {"min": 25, "raw": 25, "max": 100}, "baseFireDamage": {"min": 50, "raw": 50, "max": 75}, "baseWaterDamage": {"min": 50, "raw": 50, "max": 75}}}, {"displayName": "Revolution", "internalName": "Revolution", "type": "weapon", "subType": "bow", "icon": {"value": {"id": "minecraft:potion", "name": "bow.air3", "customModelData": {"rangeDispatch": [297]}}, "format": "attribute"}, "emblem": "diamond_6", "tier": "mythic", "attackSpeed": "verySlow", "averageDps": 759, "restriction": "none", "dropRestriction": "normal", "elements": ["earth", "water", "air"], "requirements": {"level": 111, "classRequirement": "archer", "agility": 65, "strength": 60, "intelligence": 55}, "majorIds": {"Regicide": "<span class='font-ascii' style='color:#AAAAAA'>You deal 2% more damage for every block you are away from your target (Max 120%).</span>"}, "powderSlots": 3, "lore": "<span class='font-ascii' style='color:#AAAAAA'>A boiling rage has been gathering, the pain of an entire empire yearning to be freed. With all the power of the downtrodden and the overlooked and the starved, you echo out a shout with ten thousand voices, each too quiet to hear by itself, but together a catastrophic force to make the heavens cower.</span>", "identifications": {"knockback": {"min": 39, "raw": 131, "max": 170}, "manaSteal": {"min": 4, "raw": 14, "max": 18}, "rawHealth": {"min": -3150, "raw": -2423, "max": -1696}, "rawIntelligence": 25, "mainAttackRange": {"min": -47, "raw": -36, "max": -25}, "raw2ndSpellCost": {"min": -3, "raw": -9, "max": -12}}, "base": {"baseDamage": {"min": 190, "raw": 190, "max": 260}, "baseAirDamage": {"min": 160, "raw": 160, "max": 300}, "baseEarthDamage": {"min": 210, "raw": 210, "max": 250}, "baseWaterDamage": {"min": 180, "raw": 180, "max": 280}}}, {"displayName": "Fatal", "internalName": "Masterwork Fatal", "type": "weapon", "subType": "wand", "icon": {"value": {"id": "minecraft:potion", "name": "wand.thunder3", "customModelData": {"rangeDispatch": [4356]}}, "format": "attribute"}, "emblem": "diamond_6", "tier": "mythic", "attackSpeed": "veryFast", "averageDps": 513, "restriction": "none", "dropRestriction": "never", "elements": ["thunder"], "requirements": {"level": 111, "classRequirement": "mage", "dexterity": 110}, "majorIds": {"Unstable Reaction": "<span class='font-ascii' style='color:#AAAAAA'>Judrajim no longer ramps in damage after each hit. When it expires, it releases 115% of its potential in an explosion of 20 blocks.</span>"}, "powderSlots": 3, "lore": "<span class='font-ascii' style='color:#AAAAAA'>A mage by the name of Lero claims to have harnessed the sheer power of lightning using a magical staff, however, the weapon is very unreliable in a pinch.</span>", "identifications": {"manaSteal": {"min": 3, "raw": 11, "max": 14}, "walkSpeed": {"min": 6, "raw": 20, "max": 26}, "spellDamage": {"min": 9, "raw": 31, "max": 40}, "rawDexterity": 25, "1stSpellCost": {"min": 36, "raw": 28, "max": 20}, "2ndSpellCost": {"min": -15, "raw": -49, "max": -64}, "3rdSpellCost": {"min": -4, "raw": -15, "max": -19}}, "base": {"baseThunderDamage": {"min": 1, "raw": 1, "max": 330}}}, {"displayName": "Idol", "internalName": "Masterwork Idol", "type": "weapon", "subType": "spear", "icon": {"value": {"id": "minecraft:potion", "name": "spear.water3", "customModelData": {"rangeDispatch": [3889]}}, "format": "attribute"}, "emblem": "diamond_6", "tier": "mythic", "attackSpeed": "normal", "averageDps": 584, "restriction": "none", "dropRestriction": "never", "elements": ["water"], "requirements": {"level": 111, "classRequirement": "warrior", "intelligence": 120}, "majorIds": {"Tidal Drift": "<span class='font-ascii' style='color:#AAAAAA'>Flying Kick will instead send you forwards. This effect is limited to once per Charge cast.</span>"}, "powderSlots": 3, "lore": "<span class='font-ascii' style='color:#AAAAAA'>Intricate carvings and images, almost like that of a totem pole, cover the shaft of this marvelous trident, dredged up from the Seavale Reef. Foreign magics heighten the senses of its user in battle, but also instills a longing for the ocean. Many have succumbed to this urge and drowned themselves.</span>", "identifications": {"manaRegen": {"min": 5, "raw": 18, "max": 23}, "reflection": {"min": 9, "raw": 30, "max": 39}, "waterDefence": {"min": 8, "raw": 28, "max": 36}, "rawIntelligence": 26, "rawSpellDamage": {"min": 113, "raw": 377, "max": 490}, "raw2ndSpellCost": {"min": -18, "raw": -60, "max": -78}}, "base": {"baseWaterDamage": {"min": 240, "raw": 240, "max": 330}}}, {"displayName": "Nirvana", "internalName": "Masterwork Nirvana", "type": "weapon", "subType": "dagger", "icon": {"value": {"id": "minecraft:potion", "name": "dagger.water3", "customModelData": {"rangeDispatch": [884]}}, "format": "attribute"}, "emblem": "diamond_6", "tier": "mythic", "attackSpeed": "normal", "averageDps": 717, "restriction": "none", "dropRestriction": "never", "elements": ["water"], "requirements": {"level": 111, "classRequirement": "assassin", "intelligence": 110}, "majorIds": {"Enlightenment": "<span class='font-ascii' style='color:#AAAAAA'>25% chance for spells to cost no mana and instead refund 25% of their original cost.</span>"}, "powderSlots": 3, "lore": "<span class='font-ascii' style='color:#AAAAAA'>Spiritual enlightenment is a goal that many monks hope to one day grasp the barest glimpse of, often thought to be a goal that must be worked towards over a lifetime. Holding this polished, translucent blade will instantly induce that lofty state until it is let go.</span>", "identifications": {"manaRegen": {"min": 4, "raw": 14, "max": 18}, "manaSteal": {"min": -13, "raw": -10, "max": -7}, "rawHealth": {"min": -2600, "raw": -2000, "max": -1400}, "reflection": {"min": 12, "raw": 40, "max": 52}, "spellDamage": {"min": 12, "raw": 40, "max": 52}, "rawIntelligence": 40, "mainAttackDamag